ViridianCity_Text_OldMan1_1::
	.string "This GYM didn’t have a LEADER\n"
	.string "until recently.\p"
	.string "A young man from PALLET became the\n"
	.string "LEADER, but he’s often away.$"

ViridianCity_Text_OldMan1_2::
	.string "Are you going to battle the LEADER?\n"
	.string "Good luck to you. You’ll need it.$"

ViridianCity_Text_OldMan12::
